  "description": "The versatile trail bike – With 130 mm, the Ground Control 2 strikes the perfect balance between riding comfort, control and efficiency on demanding trails or long tours. Thanks to the Schwalbe Nobby Nic Evo tyres, the bike offers excellent grip and traction on a wide variety of surfaces, so you can ride confidently and safely even on technical terrain. The balanced geometry and high-quality components ensure maximum performance and, above all, riding enjoyment on your next off-road adventure. The e*thirteen Vario Infinite seatpost, whose stroke can be shortened by 30 mm (in 5 mm increments), provides even more flexibility. This allows you to customise the bike to your needs in just a few simple steps. ¹approx. 14.5 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for taddel green frame, size L, without pedals",
